#!/bin/sh
# Legion Go: the panel is natively portrait (1600x2560 on output eDP).
# Turn it to landscape (2560x1600) at 144 Hz, falling back to the default
# rate. On other screens xrandr finds no such output or mode and changes nothing.
# Run by LightDM for the login screen and again for each session.
xrandr --output eDP --mode 1600x2560 --rate 144 --rotate left 2>/dev/null ||
	xrandr --output eDP --mode 1600x2560 --rotate left 2>/dev/null ||
	true
exit 0
